{"id":"n87847-1-8","stage":2,"title":"흉내 · 模仿","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87847-1-8-1","ko":"어디서 고양이 소리 나지 않았어?","zh":"刚才哪儿有猫叫的声音吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어디서","meaning":"哪里、哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里、哪儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디서","audio":"/audio/2239e13aeeae3639dd35.mp3"}},{"text":"고양이","meaning":"猫","explanation":"고양이：猫","readings":[{"term":"고양이","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18779","senseId":"1","lemma":"고양이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고양이","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3"}},{"text":"소리","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}},{"text":"나지","meaning":"发出，泛出，响出，有","explanation":"나다：发出，泛出，响出，有；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"16","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나지","audio":"/audio/e3dab811a03673c55137.mp3"}},{"text":"않았어?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않았어","audio":"/audio/5a7720bef7cd2ac4fcc3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里、哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"哪里、哪儿","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"2c4930ad509e4bdc","term":"고양이","zh":"猫","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3","entryId":"18779","definition":"一种可以家养的小动物，在黑暗的地方也能看清事物，擅长捉老鼠。","pronunciation":["고양이"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"声音，声，音，动静","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"物体震动发出的音波传入耳朵中产生的响声。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发出，泛出，响出，有","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"产生能察觉到的声音或气味等。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/8f8aebbed818fef18661.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87847-1-8-2","ko":"그거 내가 흉내를 낸 소리인데.","zh":"那是我自己模仿的叫声啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그거","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그거：那个","readings":[{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62251","senseId":"2","lemma":"그거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"흉내를","meaning":"模仿，效仿，仿效，学","explanation":"흉내：模仿，效仿，仿效，学；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"흉내","audio":"/audio/97b159049f065cf6e37a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87847","senseId":"1","lemma":"흉내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흉내를","audio":"/audio/c466e9af11a2c4a1ea0e.mp3"}},{"text":"낸","meaning":"模仿，学样","explanation":"내다：模仿，学样；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"내다","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89906","senseId":"27","lemma":"내다"